<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 ERP 合同模板（PDF-03）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   结构：页眉（公司名 + 「合 同」+ 合同号/状态）→ 合同概要（3 列 × N 行）→
        甲乙双方 → 金额/期限/付款方式 → 合同条款正文（**全文渲染，不截断**）→
        附件清单 → 签字盖章位（甲方 / 乙方 / 日期）+ 骑缝章提示 → 页脚。

   打印四条铁律（与订单模板同源，缺一条就踩坑）：
     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距（不写会按 Chromium 默认 Letter 出纸）；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 附件清单跨页时表头重复；
     ③ .no-break / tr { break-inside: avoid } —— 签字盖章位、合计、单个附件行
        不被腰斩（**盖章位被切到两页 = 合同作废**）；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 金额等宽右对齐。

   页码与骑缝章提示**不在本文件里**：`@page` 计数器在 Chromium printToPDF 下
   不生效、HTML 也拿不到总页数，页码由 CDP `footerTemplate`
   （`pdf::template::contract_footer`）输出 —— 每一页都会印，且左侧固定带
   「骑缝章：多页请加盖骑缝章」，这正是合同骑缝章的提示位。

   字体族：必须首选 glyf(TrueType) 静态 Noto Sans SC（NotoSansCJK-*.ttc 会让
   Chromium 退化成 Type3 字体，体积大 24 倍，见 PDF-01 证据）。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 portrait;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉 ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 18pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 10pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 2pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-sub {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 9pt;
  color: #4e5969;
}

/* ---------- 概要字段（单号 / 类型 / 状态 / 负责人 …） ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 62pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 甲乙双方（左右两栏） ---------- */
.parties {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8pt;
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.parties .party {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
}
.parties .party .cap {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3pt 0;
  font-size: 10pt;
  letter-spacing: 2pt;
}
.parties table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
.parties table td {
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: top;
  border-bottom: 0.4pt dotted #c9cdd4;
}
.parties table td.l {
  width: 46pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 金额 / 期限 / 付款方式 ---------- */
table.terms {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
}
table.terms td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.terms td.label {
  width: 74pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  text-align: center;
  color: #4e5969;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.terms td.value-cn { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; }

.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 合同条款正文（全文，保留换行） ---------- */
.section-title {
  font-size: 11pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-left: 3pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-left: 6pt;
  margin: 10pt 0 5pt;
  break-after: avoid;
  page-break-after: avoid;
}
.body-text {
  /* pre-wrap：用户在备注/条款里敲的换行、缩进必须原样出现在 PDF 上 */
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  font-size: 9.8pt;
  line-height: 1.75;
  text-align: justify;
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 6pt 8pt;
  min-height: 40pt;
}
.body-empty {
  white-space: pre-wrap;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  border: 0.5pt dashed #c9cdd4;
  padding: 6pt 8pt;
}

/* ---------- 附件清单 ---------- */
table.attach {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
table.attach thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.attach th,
table.attach td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.6pt 4pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.attach th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.attach tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
table.attach td.c-seq { text-align: center; width: 22pt; }
table.attach td.c-name { width: auto; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.attach td.c-role { width: 62pt; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
table.attach td.c-size { width: 52pt; }
table.attach td.c-user { width: 62pt; white-space: nowrap; }
table.attach td.c-time { width: 88pt; white-space: nowrap; }
.attach-empty {
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  border: 0.5pt dashed #c9cdd4;
  padding: 6pt 8pt;
}

/* ---------- 签字盖章位（整块不跨页：盖章位被切开 = 合同作废） ---------- */
.seal-block {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 14pt;
  border: 0.8pt solid #1f2329;
  padding: 8pt 10pt 10pt;
}
.seal-block .cap {
  font-size: 10.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.seal-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14pt;
}
.seal-row .cell {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-height: 86pt;
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 6pt 8pt;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  position: relative;
}
.seal-row .cell .who { font-weight: 700; }
.seal-row .cell .hint { color: #86909c; font-size: 8.5pt; margin-top: 2pt; }
.seal-row .cell .stamp {
  margin-top: 28pt;
  border-top: 0.6pt dashed #86909c;
  padding-top: 3pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
}
.seal-row .cell .date { margin-top: 10pt; color: #4e5969; font-size: 9pt; }
.seal-note {
  margin-top: 7pt;
  font-size: 8.5pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.footnote {
  margin-top: 8pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
  <div class="doc-sub">
    <span>{{ contract_name }}</span>
    <span>合同号：{{ doc_no }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<div class="parties">
  <div class="party">
    <div class="cap">甲 方</div>
    <table>
{% for field in party_a_rows %}
      <tr><td class="l">{{ field.label }}</td><td>{{ field.value }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="party">
    <div class="cap">乙 方</div>
    <table>
{% for field in party_b_rows %}
      <tr><td class="l">{{ field.label }}</td><td>{{ field.value }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<table class="terms">
  <tr>
    <td class="label">合同金额（小写）</td>
    <td class="num">{{ currency_symbol }}{{ amount }}</td>
    <td class="label">币种</td>
    <td>{{ currency }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">合同金额（大写）</td>
    <td colspan="3" class="value-cn">{{ currency_cn }}{{ amount_cn }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">合同期限</td>
    <td colspan="3">{{ term_range }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">付款方式</td>
    <td colspan="3">{{ payment_terms }}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title">合同条款（正文）</div>
{% if has_body %}
<div class="body-text">{{ body }}</div>
{% else %}
<div class="body-empty">{{ body_empty_hint }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="section-title">附件清单（共 {{ attachment_count }} 份）</div>
{% if attachments %}
<table class="attach">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th>
      <th>附件名称</th>
      <th>类型</th>
      <th>大小</th>
      <th>上传人</th>
      <th>上传时间</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for file in attachments %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-seq">{{ file.seq }}</td>
      <td class="c-name">{{ file.file_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-role">{{ file.role_label }}</td>
      <td class="c-size num">{{ file.size }}</td>
      <td class="c-user">{{ file.uploader }}</td>
      <td class="c-time">{{ file.uploaded_at }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="attach-empty">{{ attachment_empty_hint }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="seal-block">
  <div class="cap">签 字 盖 章</div>
  <div class="seal-row">
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="who">甲方（盖章）</div>
      <div class="hint">{{ party_a_name }}</div>
      <div class="stamp">单位公章 / 合同专用章</div>
      <div class="date">日期：________年____月____日</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="who">乙方（盖章）</div>
      <div class="hint">{{ party_b_name }}</div>
      <div class="stamp">单位公章 / 合同专用章</div>
      <div class="date">日期：________年____月____日</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="seal-note">{{ seal_note }}</div>
</div>

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
